### 7. EDGE CASES

### Zero Amount Deposit (Should Fail)
POST {{Banking_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "amount": 0.00
}

### Transfer to Non-existent Account
POST {{Banking_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountId": 1,
  "toAccountId": 99999,
  "amount": 100.00
}

### Get Non-existent Account Transactions
POST {{Banking_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/by-account
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 99999,
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}

### Invalid Date Range (From > To)
POST {{Banking_HostAddress}}/api/transactions/by-date-range
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromDate": "2024-12-31T23:59:59Z",
  "toDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "page": 1,
  "pageSize": 10
}